    <system:String x:Key="Disclaimer">Disclaimer</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Disclaimer1">1. This software only parses videos. It does not upload resources or store them on a server.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Disclaimer2">2. This software only parses content from Bilibili. It does not re-encode parsed audio or video; some videos undergo limited format conversion or concatenation.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Disclaimer3">3. All content parsed by this software was uploaded or shared on Bilibili by its uploaders. Copyright belongs to the original authors. Content providers and uploaders bear full responsibility for the content they provide or upload.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Disclaimer4">4. Downloaded content is for learning and exchange only. Other uses require the original rights holder’s permission. Delete it within 24 hours. To support creators, watch content on its original publishing site.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Disclaimer5">5. Commercial use is prohibited. You are responsible for any consequences of such use.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Disclaimer6">6. The software author is not responsible for any copyright issues arising from the use of this software.</system:String>

